    "text": "The correct statement on the isomerism associated with the following complex ions.<br />\r<br />\r(a) <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />\r<br />\r(b)<math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math> and<br />\r<br />\r(c) <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><